            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Adv. Meena Sharma\",\n  \"email\": \"meena.sharma@example.com\",\n  \"pricePerSession\": 800,\n  \"callFeePerMinute\": 15,\n  \"availabilityStatus\": \"Available\",\n  \"bio\": \"Adv. Meena Sharma is a highly respected legal professional specializing in complex matters, with over 15 years of experience.\",\n  \"specializations\": [\n    \"Financial Crimes\",\n    \"Cyber Law\",\n    \"Corporate Litigation\"\n  ],\n  \"languages\": [\n    \"Hindi\",\n    \"English\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "The single 'Edit Profile' call for a lawyer — name/email update the User doc, everything else updates LawyerProfile, in one request. All fields optional, send at least one. availabilityStatus: 'Available' | 'Busy'. pricePerSession bills a Chat/fixed session; callFeePerMinute bills Audio/Video by the minute. profilePhotoUrl, casesHandled and consultsCount are read-only here — set via /auth/me/photo or managed by the system."
